  "bio": "Thomas Sforacchi is a highly skilled tattoo artist based in Fontenay-le-Fleury, France, specializing in realism and black & gray styles that capture life-like detail and depth. Not only is Thomas the proud owner of Weanink and Copainsdabord_, but he also engages with fans and clients on his Twitch stream, WEANTho, showcasing his dedication to his craft and the tattoo community. All project inquiries for Thomas's sought-after work are professionally handled via email, ensuring a clear and organized communication process.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Fontenay-le-fleury, Ile-de-france, France"
